# The mirrors of this repository's release assets, in the order a reader should try them
# (mica:docs/design/mica-index.md 3.1). Each line is an absolute https base; mica-index.json
# derives one entry per line as <base>/d/mica/<scope>/<stamp>/<file>, never by asking the mirror
# what it holds. The order is the content: it is a preference list and nothing sorts it.
#
# A mirror is a source and never a trust anchor: sha256 and size beside url stay the only proof,
# and url stays the release's own URL, so a pruned mirror costs a reader nothing.
#
# This file is committed on purpose. An index built from a clean checkout of one commit is the
# same bytes everywhere, which it would not be if the base came from the environment.
https://res.micaos.dev
